      "created_at": "2016-01-30T06:47:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Just wanted to flag this bit from the Q&amp;A today with Christopher:</p><p>\n&gt; <span>grysqrl: Is the Spirit Island expansion going to be available for pre-order? Looks like just the base game right now.</span></p><p><span>GTGChristopher: @Grysqrl Good question! I'll poke Paul about it.</span></p><p><span>GTGChristopher: We'll be putting up the Spirit Island expansion soonish!\n</span></p><p><span>Full (&amp; awesome) Q&amp;A here:&nbsp;</span><span>https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/q-a-during-adam-draws-friday-8323</span></p>",
