      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Just wanted to flag this bit from the Q&amp;A today with Christopher:</p><p>\n> <span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; font-family: Consolas, Menlo, Monaco, 'Lucida Console', 'Liberation Mono', 'DejaVu Sans Mono', 'Bitstream Vera Sans Mono', monospace, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">grysqrl: Is the Spirit Island expansion going to be available for pre-order? Looks like just the base game right now.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; font-family: Consolas, Menlo, Monaco, 'Lucida Console', 'Liberation Mono', 'DejaVu Sans Mono', 'Bitstream Vera Sans Mono', monospace, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">GTGChristopher: @Grysqrl Good question! I&#39;ll poke Paul about it.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; font-family: Consolas, Menlo, Monaco, 'Lucida Console', 'Liberation Mono', 'DejaVu Sans Mono', 'Bitstream Vera Sans Mono', monospace, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">GTGChristopher: We&#39;ll be putting up the Spirit Island expansion soonish!\n</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; font-family: Consolas, Menlo, Monaco, 'Lucida Console', 'Liberation Mono', 'DejaVu Sans Mono', 'Bitstream Vera Sans Mono', monospace, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Full (&amp; awesome) Q&amp;A here:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/q-a-during-adam-draws-friday-8323</span></p>",
